# Live multi-agent worktrees. `.claude/worktrees/<run>-<n>/` is a full checkout of
# this repository that an agent is actively working in, so walking into it both
# double-counts every file and reports another agent's in-flight state as this
# checkout's. It is also the cause of the recurring eslint `tsconfigRootDir`
# failure, which is a stale-worktree symptom rather than a code defect.
.claude/
